      },
      {
        "display": "You could have texted me [because|'cause|kəˈz] I was worried.",
        "zh": "你该给我发个消息，我都担心了。"
      },
      {
        "display": "[Come on|C'mon|kəˈmɑn], I'm here now.",
        "zh": "行了，我这不是到了。"
      },
      {
        "display": "We're talking [about|'bout|əˈbaʊt] the budget today.",
        "zh": "今天说的是预算。"
      },
      {
        "display": "I read [about|'bout|əˈbaʊt] it on the way.",
        "zh": "路上我看到相关的了。"
      },
      {
        "display": "[Because|'Cause|kəˈz] of the delay?",
        "zh": "因为延误？"
      },
      {
        "display": "No, [because|'cause|kəˈz] my boss sent a summary.",
        "zh": "不是，因为我老板发了份摘要。"
      },
      {
        "display": "[Come on|C'mon|kəˈmɑn], let's go in.",
        "zh": "走吧，进去吧。"
      },
      {
        "display": "Fine. Something [about|'bout|əˈbaʊt] a new vendor?",
        "zh": "行。好像是新供应商的事？"
      }
    ],
    "tts": "azure",
    "category": "吞音"
  },
